'''Ross''' was a [[clothing]] retailer on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. The company operated several stores around [[Imperial City|Galactic City]]. The storefront showed the company's name in [[Aurebesh]] symbols, while the façade was decorated with a luminous sign that read "hot".<ref name="LL" /> At least one of the shops featured additional signage, which showed a [[human]]([[Humanoid|oid]]) in a dress/coat.<ref name="Zillo Beast Strikes Back"/> Sometimes, the Ross shops would sell their goods at a lower price than usual, whereupon a luminous "sale" sign would be put up, in order to attract customers.<ref name="LL" />

